      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4 - Way termination",
      "fontSize": 48.791629461836415,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4 - Way termination",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CsOTbfZuOKSuAXHODKbcR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12.162313495858712,
      "y": 13811.696615338467,
      "width": 623.6239535583047,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLJ4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1661097839,
      "version": 513,
      "versionNonce": 1089168578,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: If the server is also ready to close immediately when it\nreceives the client's FIN, it can combine its ACK and FIN into a\nsingle packet. This is sometimes calles a 3-way termination, but\nlogically it's still the same four actions. FIN, ACK, FIN, ACK",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: If the server is also ready to close immediately when it receives the client's FIN, it can combine its ACK and FIN into a single packet. This is sometimes calles a 3-way termination, but logically it's still the same four actions. FIN, ACK, FIN, ACK",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "zpXnxk_bQioYONK8F_P2T",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -12.162312620532614,
      "y": 13932.36263772447,
      "width": 623.8946863479194,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLJ5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 429529697,
      "version": 379,
      "versionNonce": 561758302,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Note: The server sending separate ACK adn FIN packets here\nis just one valid behavior. Some TCP implementations may\ninstead combine them into a single FIN, ACK packet. Both\nbehaviors are valid.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Note: The server sending separate ACK adn FIN packets here is just one valid behavior. Some TCP implementations may instead combine them into a single FIN, ACK packet. Both behaviors are valid.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QGsxl_zdbOzuwn5LQGxAW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1135.426158465304,
      "y": 14951.126184120867,
      "width": 854.0792236328125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLJ6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1311703681,
      "version": 484,
      "versionNonce": 358972546,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP Sequence Number\n- Every byte sent over a TCP connection is numbered\n- The Sequence Number field contains the position of the first byte of data\n- Helps the receiver to reassemble data in the correct order\n- Enables retransmission of lost segments\n- Prevents duplicate data from being accepted multiple times\n- Initial sequence numbers are shared with each other during TCP three-way handshake",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Sequence Number\n- Every byte sent over a TCP connection is numbered\n- The Sequence Number field contains the position of the first byte of data\n- Helps the receiver to reassemble data in the correct order\n- Enables retransmission of lost segments\n- Prevents duplicate data from being accepted multiple times\n- Initial sequence numbers are shared with each other during TCP three-way handshake",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6Mal89qXVIqOY39AKab7f",
      "type": "rectangle",
