    {
      "id": "RYYKEw3Kxm3AwH8QOm9gk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1401.2288394167645,
      "y": 16508.33050307482,
      "width": 1204.4050917029224,
      "height": 382.8739107155597,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLLJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1392714401,
      "version": 970,
      "versionNonce": 1637471646,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IMP\n\nAur agar maanlo segment drop ho gaya like the 1st and 3rd segment recieveer\ntak pahuch gaya but 2nd drop ho gaya in between then wo check kese karega?:\nwo dekhega ki mujhe TCP (1st) segment mil gaya seq no.1 and 3 bytes ka hai so\nnext seq no. must be 4 but seq no. 4 wala packet h nhi mila receiver ko so\nreciever sender ko acknowledge karega ki ye segment nhi mila\nthen sender firse wo segment bhejega \n\nthoda samj lena achhese nhi samja to.",
      "fontSize": 30.629912857244747,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "IMP\n\nAur agar maanlo segment drop ho gaya like the 1st and 3rd segment recieveer tak pahuch gaya but 2nd drop ho gaya in between then wo check kese karega?:\nwo dekhega ki mujhe TCP (1st) segment mil gaya seq no.1 and 3 bytes ka hai so next seq no. must be 4 but seq no. 4 wala packet h nhi mila receiver ko so reciever sender ko acknowledge karega ki ye segment nhi mila\nthen sender firse wo segment bhejega \n\nthoda samj lena achhese nhi samja to.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
