      "updated": 1786033857335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP Acknowledgement Number (ACK):\n- ACK is used to confirm successful receipt of data\n- The ACK number contains the next seq. no the receiver expects to receive\n- Helps the sender know what data has arrived and what may need retransmission",
      "fontSize": 25.13449626067013,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Acknowledgement Number (ACK):\n- ACK is used to confirm successful receipt of data\n- The ACK number contains the next seq. no the receiver expects to receive\n- Helps the sender know what data has arrived and what may need retransmission",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
