      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Mujhe IP Packet destination tak pahuchana\nhai so MTU: 1420 usko 2 fragement karega\nthen us fragemented  Paketk  aur ragment\nkarega MTU: 512 router and then wo\ndestination pachuchega to iska solution kya\nhoga?",
