      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Mujhe IP Packet destination tak pahuchana hai so MTU: 1420 usko 2 fragement karega then us fragemented  Paketk  aur ragment karega MTU: 512 router and then wo destination pachuchega to iska solution kya hoga?",
      "autoResize": false,
