      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: Is path MTU is 512 bytes the maximum TCP payload it ccan carry is, 512(MTU) - 20(IP\nHeaders) - 20(TCP Headers) = 471 bytes but, that'sfine bcz my server can handle upto 1460 bytes\n(MSS) of the segment and 472 bytes of payload is well within that limit",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTE: Is path MTU is 512 bytes the maximum TCP payload it ccan carry is, 512(MTU) - 20(IP Headers) - 20(TCP Headers) = 471 bytes but, that'sfine bcz my server can handle upto 1460 bytes (MSS) of the segment and 472 bytes of payload is well within that limit",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
