      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTE: For simplicity, this example assumes Stop-and-wait behaviour. In reality, TCP does not use the\nStop-and-Wait protocol, it uses a Sliding window, which we'll cover next in this video",
