      "text": "Why we send 3 se not 2 or 4? \nit's assuption\n\nand there are two questions\n1. How muchc receiver can handle?   3 bytes at a  time (here >_<)\n2. How much my ender can send?\nbased on this decide hota hai ki kitne segments hume bhejne chahiye",
