      "updated": 1786033872407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "e.g. Receiver k passs receive buffer hota hai of some memory jisme wo data store karta hai \n\nlet's consider receiver end pr express server run ho rha hai and receiver k pass 3 bytes buffer hai jaha se express data leta hai so\nsender send 3 segment jo fit ho gaye buffer me aur buffer get full and abhhi tak ACK nhi mila sender ko so\nsender ne 4th segment bhi ful go gaya but usko sstore karne k liye buffer me storage nhi hai so wo simply drop ho jaayega",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "e.g. Receiver k passs receive buffer hota hai of some memory jisme wo data store karta hai \n\nlet's consider receiver end pr express server run ho rha hai and receiver k pass 3 bytes buffer hai jaha se express data leta hai so\nsender send 3 segment jo fit ho gaye buffer me aur buffer get full and abhhi tak ACK nhi mila sender ko so\nsender ne 4th segment bhi ful go gaya but usko sstore karne k liye buffer me storage nhi hai so wo simply drop ho jaayega",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
