      "originalText": "In todays world hum 2GB ka data secconds me send karte hai \n\nso can be 20MB window size of receiver?? not pssible using that\n16 bits of window size in TCP header :(\n\nso to mitigate or the solution of this window size we have \nWINDOWO SCALING",
