    {
      "id": "SXaSz8HDSqkejNAnwKEzS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -263.47571980763416,
      "y": 11356.18904591619,
      "width": 685.2593994140625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLRq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1162364308,
      "version": 259,
      "versionNonce": 1793516446,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP Slow Start:\n- Congestion Window (CWND) starts with 1 MSS (or more)\n- With each ACK, CWND is increased by 1MSS\n- CWND is increases until we reach Slow Start Threshold (SSTHRESH)\n- TCP Slow Start increases CWND size exponentially",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Slow Start:\n- Congestion Window (CWND) starts with 1 MSS (or more)\n- With each ACK, CWND is increased by 1MSS\n- CWND is increases until we reach Slow Start Threshold (SSTHRESH)\n- TCP Slow Start increases CWND size exponentially",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4oaTIMjTqQ72XeClsqTPc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -263.4757191580121,
      "y": 11508.634246216043,
      "width": 938.5792236328125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLRr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 212680212,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 1176579394,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP Congestion Avoidance:\n- Once Slow Start Threshold is reached, Congestion Avoidance Algo. Takes over the TCP Start\n- With Each round Trip CWND is increased by 1MSS\n- So Congestion Avoidance increases linearly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP Congestion Avoidance:\n- Once Slow Start Threshold is reached, Congestion Avoidance Algo. Takes over the TCP Start\n- With Each round Trip CWND is increased by 1MSS\n- So Congestion Avoidance increases linearly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y4QbKFVQuLDJj-35PJnGW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -263.475719566624,
      "y": 11659.070605798654,
      "width": 1161.5989990234375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLRs",
