      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "and when window size == ssthresh (e.g. 128) it will switch the algorithm from TCP Sllow Start\nto congestion avoidance",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "and when window size == ssthresh (e.g. 128) it will switch the algorithm from TCP Sllow Start to congestion avoidance",
