      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How TCP Detects Cogestion?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How TCP Detects Cogestion?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Fn3oUXWwq0Mx1hz_sZa85",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4431.163696693369,
      "y": 10608.749372469152,
      "width": 464.704833984375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLSU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 507183020,
      "version": 241,
      "versionNonce": 1568804802,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Retransmission Tiemout (RTO)\n- Sender transmits a segment\n- Expecetd ACK does not arrive before the timeout expires\n- TCP assumes severe congestion or packet loss\n- Considered a strong indication of congestion",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Retransmission Tiemout (RTO)\n- Sender transmits a segment\n- Expecetd ACK does not arrive before the timeout expires\n- TCP assumes severe congestion or packet loss\n- Considered a strong indication of congestion",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eM1lNxqs4kcJwUpdSC25t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4431.163696531187,
      "y": 10725.38900130657,
      "width": 509.824951171875,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cLSV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1971869612,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 1060717918,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Triple Duplication ACKs\n- Receiver repeatedly acknowldges the sae missing packet\n- Sender receives 3 duplicate ACKs for the same sequence number\n- TCP assumes a packet was lost due to congestion",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Triple Duplication ACKs\n- Receiver repeatedly acknowldges the sae missing packet\n- Sender receives 3 duplicate ACKs for the same sequence number\n- TCP assumes a packet was lost due to congestion",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
