      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786033872409,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "triple duplication ACK:\nsendr ne maaanlo segment 1 2 3 bheje but segment 2 drop ho gaya and receiver only received segment 1 and 3 so\nreceiver ACK bhejega ACK 2 ese so thode time k baad firse bhejega ACK 2 if sender reeives 3 duplicate ACK then\nsender assues that packet get dropped",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "triple duplication ACK:\nsendr ne maaanlo segment 1 2 3 bheje but segment 2 drop ho gaya and receiver only received segment 1 and 3 so receiver ACK bhejega ACK 2 ese so thode time k baad firse bhejega ACK 2 if sender reeives 3 duplicate ACK then sender assues that packet get dropped",
