      "locked": false,
      "text": "depending on thee cwnd value at the time congestion is detected. the new ssthresh may be igher or lower than its previoud\nvalue. In ouur exampel, the initial ssthresh was intentionally set to a low value (128MSS) for dmonstration purpose. Since\ncongestion occured at a much larger cwnd (800MSS), the new ssthresh became higher than its previous value.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "depending on thee cwnd value at the time congestion is detected. the new ssthresh may be igher or lower than its previoud value. In ouur exampel, the initial ssthresh was intentionally set to a low value (128MSS) for dmonstration purpose. Since congestion occured at a much larger cwnd (800MSS), the new ssthresh became higher than its previous value.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
